  "title": "Monthly KPI report",
  "short": "Turn four numbers into the KPIs a manager checks every month.",
  "story": "Ravi is a junior data analyst at a chain of electronics stores in Hyderabad. At the end of every month, his manager asks for the same KPIs (key performance indicators): profit, profit margin, growth compared with last month, and how close the store came to its target.\nThe team also gets a **bonus** when the store meets its target **and** keeps a profit margin of at least 15%.\nWrite a program that asks for four numbers and prints the whole KPI report, including `True`/`False` answers for the target and the bonus.",
